{"product_id":"nemesis-1-into-the-shadows","title":"Nemesis 1: into the Shadows","description":"\u003cp\u003eRam has no memory of who he is, his background or where he has come from. He awakes in a darkened corridor of a block of flats with no idea of how he has got there. And then the lift doors nearby open and inside is a dying man...Ram is now the murder suspect and on the run. But there is something that draws him back - the dying man's last words. And as he discovers more about the murdered man, Ram becomes aware that somebody is following him, somebody with sinister intent ...Could it be something to do with his past? A tense thriller that is part of a 4-part series that will have Ram discovering more and more about his background and identity with each book.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Catherine MacPhail\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780747582687\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 304\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45297448222873,"sku":"4RF9780747582687","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/Nemesis1-intotheShadowsCatherineMacPhail.jpg?v=1752084514","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/nemesis-1-into-the-shadows","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}